    "description": "<p><a href=\"\" title=\"https://bioimage.io/#/?id=ilastik/stardist_dsb_training_data\">View on bioimage.io</a> # DSB Nucleus Segmentation Training Data </p>\n<h1>Nucleus Segmentation Training Data</h1>\n<p>Traning data for instance segmentation of nuclei. This data is a subset of the data from the <a href=\"https://bioimage.io/#/?type=application&amp;id=notebook_stardist_2d_zerocostdl4mic\">2018 Kaggle Data Science Bowl dataset\nfor nucleus segmentation</a>.\nThis subset has been used for training the <a href=\"https://github.com/stardist/stardist\">StarDist</a> nucleus segmentation model and other nucleus segmentation models on bioimagei.io.</p>",
